// Title: Use of OpenConsole
// Rule ID: 814c95cc-8192-4378-a70a-f1aafd877af1
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_lolbin_openconsole.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
